    value: "9. **M9.** From `hr.employees`, select `employee_id` and a column
      `description` that is the literal `'Emp#'` concatenated with employee_id
      (cast to string if needed: use TO_CHAR(employee_id)).  \r

      \   **Hint:** `'Emp#' || TO_CHAR(employee_id) AS description`."
